WIRE.md §6.1, §6.8 (DECISIONS 420): `load.defines` follows load.dir's link bounds; a path that
is a link whose target resolves outside the declared roots and the project is E7004
ReadOutsideRoots.
-- call --
load.defines("lnk.h")
-- type --
defines
-- symlinks --
lnk.h ../outside/x.h
-- /outside/x.h --
#define A 1
-- findings.txt --
error[E7004]  call:1:1
  cannot read lnk.h: reached through a symbolic link outside the roots and the project

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
